{
    "title": "Sprunki Horror Music Game",
    "description": "Unleash your creativity with Sprunki original, a fun, interactive music-making game!\r\nMix beats, sounds, and characters to build unique tracks in a vibrant, animated world. Drag-and-drop controls make it easy to experiment with endless combinations, giving you fresh musical possibilities every time you play. For an exciting surprise, drag the black button onto a character to transform the game with a spooky horror theme!\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\u2022 All phases: Sprunki 2, Sprunki phase 3, Sprunki phase 4\r\n\u2022 Full mods: cute vs scary beats\r\n\u2022 Build custom tracks with drag-and-drop controls\r\n\u2022 Experiment with endless sounds and character combinations\r\n\u2022 Engaging visuals and user-friendly gameplay\r\n\u2022 Easy to play online/ offline\r\n\u2022 Unlock a surprise horror theme\r\n\r\nHow to play:\r\n- Choose your sounds: pick the beats, effects, melodies, and voices.\r\n- Mix & Match: drag and drop your chosen sounds onto horror characters to start play.\r\n- Experiment: test different combinations to see how your beats blend together and create your own incredible music.\r\n- Share the music with friends.\r\n\r\nDownload Sprunki and start making incredible music!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Unleash your creativity with Sprunki original, a fun, interactive music-making game!<br>Mix beats, sounds, and characters to build unique tracks in a vibrant, animated world. Drag-and-drop controls make it easy to experiment with endless combinations, giving you fresh musical possibilities every time you play. For an exciting surprise, drag the black button onto a character to transform the game with a spooky horror theme!<br><br>Features:<br>\u2022 All phases: Sprunki 2, Sprunki phase 3, Sprunki phase 4<br>\u2022 Full mods: cute vs scary beats<br>\u2022 Build custom tracks with drag-and-drop controls<br>\u2022 Experiment with endless sounds and character combinations<br>\u2022 Engaging visuals and user-friendly gameplay<br>\u2022 Easy to play online/ offline<br>\u2022 Unlock a surprise horror theme<br><br>How to play:<br>- Choose your sounds: pick the beats, effects, melodies, and voices.<br>- Mix &amp; Match: drag and drop your chosen sounds onto horror characters to start play.<br>- Experiment: test different combinations to see how your beats blend together and create your own incredible music.<br>- Share the music with friends.<br><br>Download Sprunki and start making incredible music!",
    "summary": "Create your incredible music in Sprunki! Unlock horror mode for a spooky twist.",
